        <TextBlock Text="Stage 6 keeps these lower-level workspace controls available beneath the approval-gated job orchestrator. It can draft a unified diff, apply it only to a private snapshot, build/test that snapshot, and create a reviewable update ZIP. It cannot apply to the main repository, install, commit, or push."
                   TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#C7B28E" FontSize="10.5" Margin="3,7,3,2"/>
        <TextBlock Text="Type /draft &lt;request&gt; or use Draft Input. Then review the answer before using Apply Draft. Use /workspace recreate after the main repository changes."
                   TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#9EAAA5" FontSize="10.5" Margin="3,2,3,2"/>
       </StackPanel>
      </Expander>

